{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaks in Space</strong> is a 2D sandbox space sim featuring Combat, Ship building, Mining, Trading and Exploring a procedurally generated galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/Build_sierra2_4a.gif?t=1749541241\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design and build your own Ship part by part to suit your style, customize it for Combat, Trading, Mining, or Salvaging. Upgrade engines, weapons, cargo holds, and pressure regulators to survive the dangers of Deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/Leak_bayer.gif?t=1749541241\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique Ship Pressure Health System! Every damage creates a stackable leak that gradually reduces ship's pressure over time. Patch them during combat or risk total shutdown or retreat to a station for full repairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/PSG_sierra2_4a.gif?t=1749541241\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore those ever-changing sectors, where abandoned spaceships, deserted space stations, and hidden relics await your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/Gather_sierra2_4a.gif?t=1749541241\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources by mining asteroids or salvaging derelict ships, then sell your loot at space stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/Combat_sierra2_4a.gif?t=1749541241\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in immersive space combat, as your enemies find themselves in distress, spare them in their leak crisis, or finish them off once and for all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561170?t=1749541241","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/6b7c1e6de55a59bf0c50452f95ce267df49f93c4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749541241","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/fa51d6b5872ae2ffd273902f35ae48cd7eb90538/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749541241","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/fa51d6b5872ae2ffd273902f35ae48cd7eb90538/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749541241","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaks in Space</strong> is a 2D sandbox space sim featuring Combat, Ship building, Mining, Trading and Exploring a procedurally generated galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/Build_sierra2_4a.gif?t=1749541241\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design and build your own Ship part by part to suit your style, customize it for Combat, Trading, Mining, or Salvaging. Upgrade engines, weapons, cargo holds, and pressure regulators to survive the dangers of Deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/Leak_bayer.gif?t=1749541241\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique Ship Pressure Health System! Every damage creates a stackable leak that gradually reduces ship's pressure over time. Patch them during combat or risk total shutdown or retreat to a station for full repairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/PSG_sierra2_4a.gif?t=1749541241\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore those ever-changing sectors, where abandoned spaceships, deserted space stations, and hidden relics await your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/Gather_sierra2_4a.gif?t=1749541241\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources by mining asteroids or salvaging derelict ships, then sell your loot at space stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/Combat_sierra2_4a.gif?t=1749541241\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in immersive space combat, as your enemies find themselves in distress, spare them in their leak crisis, or finish them off once and for all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>","developers":["Frostech Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/12e7a10aae217c9cd94490684a52a732cecb9165/header.jpg?t=1749541241","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum